# Wrangler's local state: build cache, miniflare's simulated storage and dev-session metadata.
# Regenerated on demand, and it records what was bound during `wrangler pages dev`.
.wrangler

# Wrangler's own local-secrets file. This project uses .env.local instead (wrangler reads it
# automatically), but an ignore here means a future .dev.vars can never be committed by accident.
.dev.vars
